    "section_text": "Music Minor Curriculum Students will take three ensemble courses, to be chosen from Band, Choir, Orchestra. Students will take twelve credits of courses chosen from the following list: MUSIC 1150 Music Appreciation: Music of Latin America 3 MUSIC 1151 Music of Latin America 3 MUSIC 2161 Theory of Music I 3 MUSIC 2162 Theory of Music II 3 MUSIC 2163 Introduction to Composition and Arranging 3 MUSIC 3251 From the Church to the Palace: Music of the Middle Ages and Renaissance 3 MUSIC 3252 Kings, Queens, and Guillotines: History of Music in the Enlightenment and Beyond 3 MUSIC 3253 History of Music in Film 3 3. Other courses may be substituted with written permission from the Music Minor Advisor and approval from the Department Chair of ALP.",
    "section_html": "<div class=\"tab_content\" id=\"minorstextcontainer\">\n<a name=\"minorstext\"></a><h2>Music Minor Curriculum</h2> <ol> <li> Students will take three ensemble courses, to be chosen from Band, Choir, Orchestra.</li> <li>Students will take twelve credits of courses chosen from the following list:</li> </ol> <table class=\"sc_courselist\" width=\"100%\"><colgroup><col class=\"codecol\"/><col class=\"titlecol\"/><col align=\"char\" char=\".\" class=\"hourscol\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr class=\"even firstrow\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=MUSIC%201150\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'MUSIC 1150');\" title=\"MUSIC 1150\">MUSIC 1150</a></td><td>Music Appreciation:  Music of Latin America</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"odd\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=MUSIC%201151\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'MUSIC 1151');\" title=\"MUSIC 1151\">MUSIC 1151</a></td><td>Music of Latin America</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"even\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=MUSIC%202161\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'MUSIC 2161');\" title=\"MUSIC 2161\">MUSIC 2161</a></td><td>Theory of Music I</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"odd\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=MUSIC%202162\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'MUSIC 2162');\" title=\"MUSIC 2162\">MUSIC 2162</a></td><td>Theory of Music II</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"even\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=MUSIC%202163\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'MUSIC 2163');\" title=\"MUSIC 2163\">MUSIC 2163</a></td><td>Introduction to Composition and Arranging</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"odd\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=MUSIC%203251\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'MUSIC 3251');\" title=\"MUSIC 3251\">MUSIC 3251</a></td><td>From the Church to the Palace:  Music of the Middle Ages and Renaissance</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"even\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=MUSIC%203252\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'MUSIC 3252');\" title=\"MUSIC 3252\">MUSIC 3252</a></td><td>Kings, Queens, and Guillotines: History of Music in the Enlightenment and Beyond</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"odd lastrow\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=MUSIC%203253\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'MUSIC 3253');\" title=\"MUSIC 3253\">MUSIC 3253</a></td><td>History of Music in Film</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> </tbody></table> <p>   3. Other courses may be substituted with written permission from the Music Minor Advisor and approval from the Department Chair of ALP.</p>\n</div>"
